 "kind": "html",
 "prompt": "Build a single-page Three.js demo of a segmented cube that explodes outward on click and reassembles with easing. Add raycast hover highlighting, piece spin animation, and user controls for explosion strength and reset. Keep visuals clean with shadows and soft ambient fill. Output one self-contained HTML file with inline JavaScript.",
 "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Segmented Cube — Three.js Explode Demo</title>\n<style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    html, body {\n        width: 100%; height: 100%;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        background: radial-gradient(1200px 800px at 50% 28%, #222a52 0%, #141a38 45%, #0a0d1f 100%);\n        color: #e8ecf8;\n    }\n\n    #app { position: fixed; inset: 0; }\n    canvas { display: block; }\n\n    .panel {\n        position: fixed;\n        top: 22px; left: 22px;\n        width: 258px;\n        padding: 18px 20px 20px;\n        background: rgba(15, 19, 40, 0.6);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\n        border-radius: 16px;\n        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n        box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n        user-select: none;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n        margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n    .brand .dot {\n        width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px;\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b93ff, #e08be8);\n        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(139, 147, 255, 0.7);\n    }\n    .brand h1 {\n        font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;\n        color: #f2f4ff;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n        font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.5);\n        margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    }\n\n    .row { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n    .row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n    .label-line {\n        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;\n        margin-bottom: 7px;\n    }\n    .label-line label {\n        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\n        letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;\n        color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.65);\n    }\n    .label-line .val {\n        font-family: ui-monospace, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n        font-size: 11.5px; color: #a8b0ff;\n        background: rgba(139, 147, 255, 0.12);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(139, 147, 255, 0.25);\n        padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 6px;\n    }\n\n    input[type=\"range\"] {\n        width: 100%; height: 4px;\n        appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n        border-radius: 4px; outline: none; cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    input[type=\"range\"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n        appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;\n        width: 15px; height: 15px; border-radius: 50%;\n        background: #aab1ff;\n        border: 2px solid #0e1230;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(139, 147, 255, 0.8);\n        cursor: pointer;\n        transition: transform 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    input[type=\"range\"]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover { transform: scale(1.2); }\n    input[type=\"range\"]::-moz-range-thumb {\n        width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%;\n        background: #aab1ff; border: 2px solid #0e1230;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(139, 147, 255, 0.8);\n        cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    select {\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: 7px 10px;\n        font-size: 12.5px; color: #e8ecf8;\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n        border-radius: 9px; outline: none; cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    select option { background: #141a38; color: #e8ecf8; }\n\n    .btn-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }\n\n    button {\n        flex: 1;\n        padding: 9px 0;\n        font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600;\n        letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    button:active { transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98); }\n\n    .btn-primary {\n        color: #fff;\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c73ff, #a855f7);\n        border: none;\n        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(108, 115, 255, 0.4);\n    }\n    .btn-primary:hover {\n        box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(108, 115, 255, 0.6);\n        transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .btn-ghost {\n        color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.8);\n        background: transparent;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n    }\n    .btn-ghost:hover {\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n        transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .hint {\n        position: fixed;\n        bottom: 20px; left: 50%;\n        transform: translateX(-50%);\n        font-size: 12px;\n        letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n        color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.45);\n        background: rgba(15, 19, 40, 0.5);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);\n        padding: 8px 18px;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .hint b { color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.75); font-weight: 600; }\n\n    @media (max-width: 560px) {\n        .panel { width: calc(100vw - 44px); }\n        .hint { font-size: 11px; padding: 7px 14px; }\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div id=\"app\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n        <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n        <h1>Segmented Cube</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">Three.js explode &amp; reassemble demo</div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-line\">\n            <label for=\"strength\">Explosion strength</label>\n            <span class=\"val\" id=\"strengthVal\">1.30×</span>\n        </div>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"strength\" min=\"0.4\" max=\"2.4\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"1.3\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-line\">\n            <label for=\"segments\">Segments per side</label>\n        </div>\n        <select id=\"segments\">\n            <option value=\"2\">2 × 2 × 2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3 × 3 × 3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4 × 4 × 4</option>\n        </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"btn-row\">\n        <button class=\"btn-primary\" id=\"explodeBtn\">Explode</button>\n        <button class=\"btn-ghost\" id=\"resetBtn\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hint\"><b>Click</b> the cube to explode &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Drag</b> to orbit &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Scroll</b> to zoom &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Space</b> toggles</div>\n\n<script type=\"importmap\">\n{\n    \"imports\": {\n        \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\",\n        \"three/addons/\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/examples/jsm/\"\n    }\n}\n</script>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoundedBoxGeometry } from 'three/addons/geometries/RoundedBoxGeometry.js';\n\nconst container = document.getElementById('app');\nconst strengthInput = document.getElementById('strength');\nconst strengthVal = document.getElementById('strengthVal');\nconst segmentsSelect = document.getElementById('segments');\nconst explodeBtn = document.getElementById('explodeBtn');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');\n\nconst scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\nconst camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(42, innerWidth / innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\ncamera.position.set(6.0, 4.6, 7.4);\n\nconst renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2));\nrenderer.setSize(innerWidth, innerHeight);\nrenderer.shadowMap.enabled = true;\nrenderer.shadowMap.type = THREE.PCFSoftShadowMap;\nrenderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\nrenderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.06;\ncontainer.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('contextmenu', e => e.preventDefault());\n\nconst controls = new OrbitControls(camera, renderer.domElement);\ncontrols.enableDamping = true;\ncontrols.dampingFactor = 0.06;\ncontrols.minDistance = 4;\ncontrols.maxDistance = 18;\ncontrols.target.set(0, 0.1, 0);\ncontrols.autoRotate = true;\ncontrols.autoRotateSpeed = 0.7;\n\nlet idleTimer;\ncontrols.addEventListener('start', () => {\n    controls.autoRotate = false;\n    clearTimeout(idleTimer);\n});\ncontrols.addEventListener('end', () => {\n    clearTimeout(idleTimer);\n    idleTimer = setTimeout(() => { controls.autoRotate = true; }, 2500);\n});\n\nconst hemi = new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xdfe8ff, 0x252b4a, 0.85);\nscene.add(hemi);\nscene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.28));\n\nconst keyLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 2.5);\nkeyLight.position.set(6, 10, 5);\nkeyLight.castShadow = true;\nkeyLight.shadow.mapSize.set(2048, 2048);\nkeyLight.shadow.camera.left = -8;\nkeyLight.shadow.camera.right = 8;\nkeyLight.shadow.camera.top = 8;\nkeyLight.shadow.camera.bottom = -8;\nkeyLight.shadow.camera.near = 2;\nkeyLight.shadow.camera.far = 30;\nkeyLight.shadow.bias = -0.0002;\nkeyLight.shadow.normalBias = 0.025;\nscene.add(keyLight);\n\nconst fillLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xbfd0ff, 0.55);\nfillLight.position.set(-7, 3, -5);\nscene.add(fillLight);\n\nconst rimLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffd9f2, 0.35);\nrimLight.position.set(2, 4, -8);\nscene.add(rimLight);\n\nconst ground = new THREE.Mesh(\n    new THREE.CircleGeometry(16, 72),\n    new THREE.ShadowMaterial({ opacity: 0.3, color: 0x060818 })\n);\nground.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\nground.position.y = -2.35;\nground.receiveShadow = true;\nscene.add(ground);\n\nconst ring = new THREE.Mesh(\n    new THREE.RingGeometry(3.14, 3.2, 128),\n    new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x9aa4ff, transparent: true, opacity: 0.09, side: THREE.DoubleSide })\n);\nring.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\nring.position.y = -2.34;\nscene.add(ring);\n\nconst cubeGroup = new THREE.Group();\nscene.add(cubeGroup);\n\nlet pieces = [];\nlet pieceMeshes = [];\nlet sharedGeo = null;\nlet strength = parseFloat(strengthInput.value);\nlet exploded = false;\n\nconst easeOutCubic = t => 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\nconst easeInOutCubic = t => t < 0.5 ? 4 * t * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 3) / 2;\n\nconst randUnit = () => {\n    const v = new THREE.Vector3(\n        Math.random() * 2 - 1,\n        Math.random() * 2 - 1,\n        Math.random() * 2 - 1\n    );\n    return v.lengthSq() < 1e-6 ? v.set(0, 1, 0) : v.normalize();\n};\n\nfunction build(n) {\n    for (const m of pieceMeshes) {\n        m.material.dispose();\n        cubeGroup.remove(m);\n    }\n    if (sharedGeo) sharedGeo.dispose();\n\n    pieces = [];\n    pieceMeshes = [];\n\n    const total = 3.0;\n    const spacing = total / n;\n    const size = spacing * 0.88;\n    const half = (n - 1) / 2;\n    const maxDist = Math.max(half * spacing * Math.sqrt(3), 1e-4);\n\n    sharedGeo = new RoundedBoxGeometry(size, size, size, 4, size * 0.14);\n\n    for (let x = 0; x < n; x++) {\n        for (let y = 0; y < n; y++) {\n            for (let z = 0; z < n; z++) {\n                const home = new THREE.Vector3(x - half, y - half, z - half).multiplyScalar(spacing);\n                const dist = home.length();\n                const distNorm = dist / maxDist;\n                const dir = dist > 1e-4 ? home.clone().normalize() : randUnit();\n\n                const spread = dir.clone()\n                    .multiplyScalar(0.9 + 1.4 * distNorm)\n                    .addScaledVector(randUnit(), 0.32)\n                    .multiplyScalar(spacing);\n\n                const diag = (x + y + z) / (3 * Math.max(n - 1, 1));\n                const color = new THREE.Color().setHSL(0.58 + 0.3 * diag, 0.55, 0.62);\n\n                const mat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                    color,\n                    roughness: 0.34,\n                    metalness: 0.08,\n                    emissive: color,\n                    emissiveIntensity: 0\n                });\n\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(sharedGeo, mat);\n                mesh.position.copy(home);\n                mesh.castShadow = true;\n                mesh.receiveShadow = true;\n                cubeGroup.add(mesh);\n                pieceMeshes.push(mesh);\n\n                const p = {\n                    mesh,\n                    home,\n                    spread,\n                    distNorm,\n                    axis: randUnit(),\n                    spinBase: (Math.PI * (0.9 + Math.random() * 1.8)) * (Math.random() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1),\n                    spinRate: (0.35 + Math.random() * 0.75) * (Math.random() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1),\n                    clock: 0,\n                    p: 0, p0: 0, target: 0,\n                    start: 0, dur: 1,\n                    ease: easeOutCubic,\n                    hov: 0\n                };\n                mesh.userData.piece = p;\n                pieces.push(p);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    exploded = false;\n    explodeBtn.textContent = 'Explode';\n}\n\nfunction setExploded(on) {\n    exploded = on;\n    const now = clock.elapsedTime;\n    for (const p of pieces) {\n        p.p0 = p.p;\n        p.target = on ? 1 : 0;\n        p.start = now + (on\n            ? p.distNorm * 0.22 + Math.random() * 0.08\n            : (1 - p.distNorm) * 0.14 + Math.random() * 0.06);\n        p.dur = on ? 0.85 + Math.random() * 0.3 : 1.05 + Math.random() * 0.3;\n        p.ease = on ? easeOutCubic : easeInOutCubic;\n    }\n    explodeBtn.textContent = on ? 'Assemble' : 'Explode';\n}\n\nfunction reset() {\n    exploded = false;\n    for (const p of pieces) {\n        p.p = 0; p.p0 = 0; p.target = 0; p.clock = 0;\n        p.mesh.position.copy(p.home);\n        p.mesh.quaternion.identity();\n    }\n    explodeBtn.textContent = 'Explode';\n}\n\nexplodeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setExploded(!exploded));\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', reset);\n\nstrengthInput.addEventListener('input', () => {\n    strength = parseFloat(strengthInput.value);\n    strengthVal.textContent = strength.toFixed(2) + '×';\n});\n\nsegmentsSelect.addEventListener('change', () => build(parseInt(segmentsSelect.value, 10)));\n\naddEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    if (e.code === 'Space' && e.target === document.body) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        setExploded(!exploded);\n    }\n});\n\nlet downX = 0, downY = 0, downT = 0;\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => {\n    downX = e.clientX; downY = e.clientY; downT = performance.now();\n});\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerup', e => {\n    const moved = Math.hypot(e.clientX - downX, e.clientY - downY);\n    if (moved < 6 && performance.now() - downT < 350) setExploded(!exploded);\n});\n\nconst pointer = new THREE.Vector2();\nlet pointerActive = false;\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n    pointer.x = (e.clientX / innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n    pointer.y = -(e.clientY / innerHeight) * 2 + 1;\n    pointerActive = true;\n});\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => {\n    pointerActive = false;\n    hovered = null;\n});\n\nconst raycaster = new THREE.Raycaster();\nlet hovered = null;\nconst clock = new THREE.Clock();\nconst tmpQuat = new THREE.Quaternion();\n\nfunction animate() {\n    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    const dt = Math.min(clock.getDelta(), 0.05);\n    const now = clock.elapsedTime;\n\n    controls.update();\n\n    if (pointerActive) {\n        raycaster.setFromCamera(pointer, camera);\n        const hits = raycaster.intersectObjects(pieceMeshes, false);\n        hovered = hits.length ? hits[0].object.userData.piece : null;\n    }\n    document.body.style.cursor = hovered ? 'pointer' : '';\n\n    for (const p of pieces) {\n        const raw = THREE.MathUtils.clamp((now - p.start) / p.dur, 0, 1);\n        p.p = p.p0 + (p.target - p.p0) * p.ease(raw);\n        if (p.p > 0.999) p.clock += dt;\n\n        p.mesh.position.copy(p.home).addScaledVector(p.spread, strength * p.p);\n        tmpQuat.setFromAxisAngle(p.axis, p.p * (p.spinBase + p.clock * p.spinRate));\n        p.mesh.quaternion.copy(tmpQuat);\n\n        p.hov = THREE.MathUtils.damp(p.hov, hovered === p ? 1 : 0, 14, dt);\n        p.mesh.material.emissiveIntensity = 0.6 * p.hov;\n        p.mesh.scale.setScalar(1 + 0.09 * p.hov);\n    }\n\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n}\n\naddEventListener('resize', () => {\n    camera.aspect = innerWidth / innerHeight;\n    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth, innerHeight);\n});\n\nbuild(3);\nanimate();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
}